      "message": "Thanks! I did not know this.\n\nBut I tried to use testAndCleanup and I was not sure how to use this if I want to allocate some resource in test section with some variable and free the resource in cleanup section.\nBecause I can not assign to non final variable in test and cleanup section.\nFor example, I want to initialize tunFd in test section and free in cleanup section.\nBut, If I declare tunFd as final, I can not do `tunFd\u003d...` in test section.\n\nIf I\u0027m misunderstanding the use of testAndCleanup please tell me.\n\nI was checking testAndCleanup and realized that I need to care the exception in finally section.\nI have updated to take care the case `Os.close` throw exception.",
